        <gr str="1715">before </gr>the judgment <gr str="968">seat </gr>of <gr str="5547">Christ</gr>; <gr str="2443">that </gr>every <gr str="1538">one </gr>may <gr str="2865">receive </gr>the things <STYLE css="font-style:italic">done </STYLE>
